    "message": "fix(install): restore the uv version helpers dropped with the agent code\n\nRemoving the coding-agent block also took current_uv_version, version_ge, and\nverify_uv, which sit between it and ensure_uv. Also updates the installer\ncontract assertions: the wheel URL is now assembled from the release feed, so\nthe script must carry the repo and feed rather than a pinned version or\nchecksum, and must not reference the agent installers at all.",
